---
// OWNER REVIEW REQUIRED before launch: legal entity name, information officer, email routing,
// processors and any analytics. See CONTENT_CONFIRMATIONS.md.
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { business } from '../config/site';
---
<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" heading="Privacy policy" path="/privacy-policy/" description="How Neovantis handles the personal information you provide through the website enquiry form, in line with the Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA).">
  <p>This policy explains how {business.name} handles personal information submitted through this website. It applies to the website and its enquiry form only.</p>

  <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
  <p>{business.name}, {business.address.line1}, {business.address.locality}, {business.address.postalCode}, {business.address.region}, {business.address.country}, is the responsible party for personal information collected through this website under the Protection of Personal Information Act, 2013 (POPIA). You can contact us about privacy at <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a> or on <a href={business.phone.href}>{business.phone.display}</a>.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>When you send an enquiry, we collect the information you enter in the form:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Required: your name, email address, the speciality, the enquiry type and your message</li>
    <li>Optional: your organisation, professional role, region and telephone number</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The form asks you not to include patient names, scans or other patient information. Please do not send health information about any person through this website. If we receive it, we will not use it for any purpose and will delete it.</p>
  <p>Like most websites, our hosting provider automatically processes technical information such as IP addresses and browser details to deliver and secure the website.</p>

  <h2>Why we use it</h2>
  <p>We use enquiry information to respond to your enquiry, to discuss products and supply arrangements you ask about, and to keep a record of our correspondence. We do not sell your personal information. We do not use your enquiry for marketing unless you separately agree to receive it.</p>

  <h2>Who processes it for us</h2>
  <p>This website is hosted by Netlify, Inc., which also receives and stores enquiry form submissions on our behalf. Netlify is based in the United States, so your information may be processed outside South Africa. Form submissions are forwarded to our business email so that our team can respond.</p>
  <p>The website does not currently use analytics or advertising cookies. If that changes, we will update this policy first.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>We keep enquiry information for as long as we need it to respond to you and to maintain our business records, and in line with our legal obligations. We then delete it or make it anonymous.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Under POPIA you may ask whether we hold personal information about you, request access to it, ask us to correct or delete it, and object to its processing. Contact us using the details above. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Information Regulator (South Africa) at <a href="https://inforegulator.org.za/" rel="noopener">inforegulator.org.za</a>.</p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>The website is served over an encrypted connection (HTTPS). We take reasonable steps to protect the information we hold, but no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. The current version will always be published on this page.</p>
</LegalLayout>
